WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Everyone has seen the news, right?

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,560
Our country has power

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,640
Completely capable of dealing with this blood disaster

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,560
Don't be nervous

5
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,040
It will all be overtaken

6
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:11,040
Zhang Yi, are you okay?

7
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,240
I'm fine

8
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,720
That's good

9
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:14,840
care about me

10
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,920
Are you concerned about the supplies in my hands?

11
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,120
No food left

12
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,160
I remember you bought a lot of things

13
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,760
Can you give me some?

14
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,880
I'll invite you to dinner later.

15
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:27,620
Sure enough, it’s for food again

16
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:33,130
Finally replied to my message

17
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,730
Damn Zhang Yi

18
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:36,170
what does he mean

19
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:38,490
Are you angry with me?

20
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:40,090
This Zhang Yi is too much

21
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:41,770
It's a shame he kept saying he liked you in the past

22
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:43,330
Now that I have delicious food, I can’t even think of you

23
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:44,690
Totally hypocritical
